.TH "NETPLAN\-IP" "8" "" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
\f[CR]netplan\-ip\f[R] \- retrieve IP information (like DHCP leases)
from the system
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\f[B]\f[CB]netplan\f[B]\f[R] [\f[I]\-\-debug\f[R]] \f[B]ip\f[R]
\f[B]\-h\f[R]|\f[B]\-\-help\f[R]
.PP
\f[B]\f[CB]netplan\f[B]\f[R] [\f[I]\-\-debug\f[R]] \f[B]ip\f[R]
\f[I]COMMAND\f[R] [\f[I]\-\-root\-dir=ROOT_DIR\f[R]] \f[I]ARGUMENTS\f[R]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
\f[B]\f[CB]netplan ip\f[B]\f[R] retrieves IP information (like DHCP
leases) from the system.
.SH DHCP COMMANDS
.TP
\f[B]\f[CB]leases\f[B]\f[R] \f[CR]INTERFACE\f[R]
Displays DHCP IP leases
.RS
.PP
Example: \f[CR]netplan ip leases enp5s0\f[R]
.RE
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\f[CR]\-h\f[R], \f[CR]\-\-help\f[R]
Print basic help.
.TP
\f[CR]\-\-debug\f[R]
Print debugging output during the process.
.TP
\f[CR]\-\-root\-dir\f[R]
Read YAML files from this root instead of \f[CR]/\f[R].
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\f[B]\f[CB]netplan\f[B]\f[R](5), \f[B]\f[CB]netplan\-get\f[B]\f[R](8),
\f[B]\f[CB]netplan\-status\f[B]\f[R](8)
